pub-id-type="doi">10.1159/000029273</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B8"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Meduri</surname><given-names>GU</given-names></name><name><surname>Headley</surname><given-names>AS</given-names></name><name><surname>Golden</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name><name><surname>Carson</surname><given-names>SJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Umberger</surname><given-names>RA</given-names></name><name><surname>Kelso</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Tolley</surname><given-names>EA</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Effect of prolonged methylprednisolone therapy in unresolving acute respiratory distress syndrome: a randomized controlled trial</article-title><source>JAMA</source><year>1998</year><volume>280</volume><fpage>159</fpage><lpage>165</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">9669790</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1001/jama.280.2.159</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B9"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Keh</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><name><surname>Boehnke</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Weber-Cartens</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Schulz</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><name><surname>Ahlers</surname><given-names>O</given-names></name><name><surname>Bercker</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Volk</surname><given-names>HD</given-names></name><name><surname>Doecke</surname><given-names>WD</given-names></name><name><surname>Falke</surname><given-names>KJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Gerlach</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Immunologic and hemodynamic effects of "low-dose" hydrocortisone in septic shock: a double-blind, randomized, placebo-controlled, crossover study</article-title><source>Am J Respir Crit Care Med</source><year>200